{"text":"<p><br /></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZdKhFYsTv7c</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> ### 2. Khandhayamakaṃ ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9.804621\">00:09</span> #### 1. Paṇṇattivāro ^6-2a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) uddeso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16.727686\">00:16</span> 1. Pañcakkhandhā – rūpakkhandho, vedanākkhandho, saññākkhandho, saṅkhārakkhandho, viññāṇakkhandho. ^6-2a-1</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Padasodhanavāro ^6-2b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"36.609457\">00:36</span> 2. (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandho? ^6-2b-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"40.825532\">00:40</span> (Kha) rūpakkhandho rūpaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"42.856601\">00:42</span> (Ka) vedanā vedanākkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"45.817404\">00:45</span> (Kha) vedanākkhandho vedanā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"48.5428\">00:48</span> (Ka) saññā saññākkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"51.145822\">00:51</span> (Kha) saññākkhandho saññā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"54.184584\">00:54</span> (Ka) saṅkhārā saṅkhārakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"56.62467\">00:56</span> (Kha) saṅkhārakkhandho saṅkhārā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"60.006985\">01:00</span> (Ka) viññāṇaṃ viññāṇakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"62.580457\">01:02</span> (Kha) viññāṇakkhandho viññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"69.38062\">01:09</span> 3. (Ka) na rūpaṃ na rūpakkhandho? ^6-2b-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"75.462268\">01:15</span> (Kha) na rūpakkhandho na rūpaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"78.636195\">01:18</span> (Ka) na vedanā na vedanākkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"81.7054\">01:21</span> (Kha) na vedanākkhandho na vedanā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"85.475686\">01:25</span> (Ka) na saññā na saññākkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"88.570145\">01:28</span> (Kha) na saññākkhandho na saññā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"91.620817\">01:31</span> (Ka) na saṅkhārā na saṅkhārakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"95.044832\">01:35</span> (Kha) na saṅkhārakkhandho na saṅkhārā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"99.070637\">01:39</span> (Ka) na viññāṇaṃ na viññāṇakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"102.272413\">01:42</span> (Kha) na viññāṇakkhandho na viññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"105.808924\">01:45</span> #### 2. Padasodhanamūlacakkavāro ^6-2c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"114.984526\">01:54</span> 4. (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandho? ^6-2c-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"121.521759\">02:01</span> (Kha) khandhā vedanākkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"123.989196\">02:03</span>(Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"126.914618\">02:06</span> (Kha) khandhā saññākkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"129.538085\">02:09</span> (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"131.811111\">02:11</span> (Kha) khandhā saṅkhārakkhandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"134.91381\">02:1