ññāṇaṃ na khandho? ^6-2e-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"684.00332\">11:24</span> (Kha) na khandhā na rūpaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"686.696905\">11:26</span> (Ka) na viññāṇaṃ na khandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"689.053089\">11:29</span> (Kha) na khandhā na vedanā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"691.93938\">11:31</span> (Ka) na viññāṇaṃ na khandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"694.105419\">11:34</span> (Kha) na khandhā na saññā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"696.870952\">11:36</span> (Ka) na viññāṇaṃ na khandho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"699.127591\">11:39</span> (Kha) na khandhā na saṅkhārā?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"730.906461\">12:10</span>  Paṇṇattiuddesavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Kha) niddeso</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Paṇṇattivāraniddesa ^6-2f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Padasodhanavāro ^6-2g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"735.525462\">12:15</span> 26. (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandhoti? ^6-2g-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"741.452877\">12:21</span> Piyarūpaṃ sātarūpaṃ rūpaṃ, na rūpakkhandho. Rūpakkhandho rūpañceva rūpakkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"751.873498\">12:31</span> (Kha) rūpakkhandho rūpanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"756.460743\">12:36</span> (Ka) vedanā vedanākkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"765.831579\">12:45</span> (Kha) vedanākkhandho vedanāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"771.121609\">12:51</span> (Ka) saññā saññākkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"777.6044\">12:57</span> Diṭṭhisaññā saññā, na saññākkhandho. Saññākkhandho saññā ceva saññākkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"788.290578\">13:08</span> (Kha) saññākkhandho saññāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"793.173144\">13:13</span> (Ka) saṅkhārā saṅkhārakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"800.535842\">13:20</span> Saṅkhārakkhandhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saṅkhārā [avasesā saṅkhārā saṅkhārā (syā.)], na saṅkhārakkhandho. Saṅkhārakkhandho saṅkhārā ceva saṅkhārakkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"813.807113\">13:33</span> (Kha) saṅkhārakkhandho saṅkhārāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"819.881772\">13:39</span> (Ka) viññāṇaṃ viññāṇakkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"829.227629\">13:49</span> (Kha) viññāṇakkhandho viññāṇanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"840.098119\">14:00</span> 27. (Ka) na rūpaṃ na rūpakkhandhoti? Āmantā. ^6-2g-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"848.50084\">14:08</span> (Kha) na rūpakkhandho na rūpanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"852.229086\">14:12</span> Piyarūpaṃ sātarūpaṃ na rūpakkhandho, rūpaṃ. Rūpañca rūpakkhandhañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva rūpaṃ na ca rūpakkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"865.387379\">14:25</span> (Ka) na vedanā na vedanākkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"875.093245\">14:35</span> (Kha) na vedanākkhandho na vedanāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"880.822668\">14:40</span> (Ka) na saññā na saññākkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"890.260478\">14:50</span> (Kha) na saññākkhandho na saññāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"894.335494\">14:54</span> Diṭṭhisaññā na saññākkhandho, saññā. Saññañca saññākkhandhañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva saññā na ca saññākkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"909.432757\">15:09</span> (Ka) na saṅkhārā na saṅkhārakkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"920.361022\">15:20</span> (Kha) na saṅkhārakkhandho na saṅkhārāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"925.119364\">15:25</span> Saṅkhārakkhandhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā na saṅkhārakkhandho, saṅkhārā. Saṅkhāre ca saṅkhārakkhandhañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva saṅkhārā na ca saṅkhārakkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"942.203136\">15:42</span> (Ka) na viññāṇaṃ na viññāṇakkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"952.126314\">15:52</span> (Kha) na viññāṇakkhandho na viññāṇanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"962.545705\">16:02</span> #### 2. Padasodhanamūlacakkavāro ^6-2h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"972.637312\">16:12</span> 28. (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandhoti? ^6-2h-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"975.764935\">16:15</span> Piyarūpaṃ sātarūpaṃ rūpaṃ, na rūpakkhandho. Rūpakkhandho rūpañceva rūpakkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"985.52612\">16:25</span> (Kha) khandhā vedanākkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"989.459856\">16:29</span> Vedanākkhandho khandho ceva vedanākkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"994.540313\">16:34</span> Avasesā khandhā [avasesā khandhā khandhā (syā.) evamuparipi] na vedanākkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1002.002023\">16:42</span> (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1006.466415\">16:46</span> Piyarūpaṃ sātarūpaṃ rūpaṃ, na rūpakkhandho. Rūpakkhandho rūpañceva rūpakkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1015.987564\">16:55</span> (Kha) khandhā saññākkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1019.530071\">16:59</span> Saññākkhandho khandho ceva saññākkhandho ca. Avasesā khandhā na saññākkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1028.204798\">17:08</span> (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1035.555245\">17:15</span> Piyarūpaṃ sātarūpaṃ rūpaṃ, na rūpakkhandho. Rūpakkhandho rūpañceva rūpakkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1045.629038\">17:25</span> (Kha) khandhā saṅkhārakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1048.374261\">17:28</span> Saṅkhārakkhandho khandho ceva saṅkhārakkhandho ca. Avasesā khandhā na saṅkhārakkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1058.099604\">17:38</span> (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1065.658717\">17:45</span> Piyarūpaṃ sātarūpaṃ rūpaṃ, na rūpakkhandho. Rūpakkhandho rūpañceva rūpakkhandho ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1075.494614\">17:55</span> (Kha) khandhā viññāṇakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1078.66207\">17:58</span> Viññāṇakkhandho khandho ceva viññāṇakkhandho ca. Avasesā khandhā na viññāṇakkhandho.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1087.888818\">18:07</span> 29. (Ka) vedanā vedanākkhandhoti? Āmantā. ^6-2h-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1097.199235\">18:17</span> (Kha) khandhā rūpakkhandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1099.800329\">18:19</span> Rūpakkhandho khandho ceva r