" data-timestamp=\"2936.349826\">48:56</span> Viññāṇaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā khandhā na viññāṇaṃ, khandhā. Viññāṇañca khandhe ca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva viññāṇaṃ na ca khandhā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2950.23039\">49:10</span> (Kha) na khandhā na saññākkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2956.078309\">49:16</span> (Ka) na viññāṇaṃ na khandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2963.688427\">49:23</span> Viññāṇaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā khandhā na viññāṇaṃ, khandhā. Viññāṇañca khandhe ca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva viññāṇaṃ na ca khandhā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2977.833734\">49:37</span> (Kha) na khandhā na saṅkhārakkhandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2989.361747\">49:49</span> Paṇṇattiniddesavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2994.273991\">49:54</span> #### 2. Pavattivāro 1. uppādavāro ^6-2k-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3006.146918\">50:06</span> #### (1) Paccuppannavāro ^6-2l-0</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3014.387521\">50:14</span>  50. (Ka) yassa rūpakkhandho uppajjati tassa vedanākkhandho uppajjatīti? ^6-2l-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3024.806769\">50:24</span> Asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ vedanākkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati vedanākkhandho ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3047.23559\">50:47</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana vedanākkhandho uppajjati tassa rūpakkhandho uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3058.690754\">50:58</span> Arūpaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ rūpakkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho ca uppajjati rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3081.171338\">51:21</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3083.921789\">51:23</span> 51. (Ka) yattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjatīti? ^6-2l-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3095.065072\">51:35</span> Asaññasatte tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati, no ca tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāre tattha rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati vedanākkhandho ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3114.255514\">51:54</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana vedanākkhandho uppajjati tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3125.728649\">52:05</span> Arūpe tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati, no ca tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāre tattha vedanākkhandho ca uppajjati rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3143.263399\">52:23</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3146.175371\">52:26</span> 52. (Ka) yassa yattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati tassa tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjatīti? ^6-2l-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3158.170035\">52:38</span> Asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati vedanākkhandho ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3182.135664\">53:02</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati tassa tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3193.985875\">53:13</span> Arūpaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantān