khandho uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ vedanākkhandho uppajjissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho ca uppajjittha vedanākkhandho ca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5501.934\">1:31:41</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana vedanākkhandho uppajjissati tassa rūpakkhandho uppajjitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5516.81134\">1:31:56</span> 93. (Ka) yassa vedanākkhandho uppajjittha tassa saññākkhandho uppajjissatīti? ^6-2q-93</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5529.578443\">1:32:09</span> Pacchimabhavikānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ saññākkhandho uppajjissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho ca uppajjittha saññākkhandho ca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5549.023326\">1:32:29</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana saññākkhandho uppajjissati tassa vedanākkhandho uppajjitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5564.316757\">1:32:44</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5569.094804\">1:32:49</span> 94. (Ka) yattha rūpakkhandho uppajjittha tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjissatīti? ^6-2q-94</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5578.257084\">1:32:58</span> Asaññasatte tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjittha, no ca tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjissati. Pañcavokāre tattha rūpakkhandho ca uppajjittha vedanākkhandho ca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5596.437762\">1:33:16</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana vedanākkhandho uppajjissati tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5608.560334\">1:33:28</span> Arūpe tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjissati, no ca tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjittha. Pañcavokāre tattha vedanākkhandho ca uppajjissati rūpakkhandho ca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5626.094279\">1:33:46</spa