āro ^6-2x-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8162.547324\">2:16:02</span> 143. (Ka) yassa rūpakkhandho nirujjhittha tassa vedanākkhandho nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2x-143</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8173.260808\">2:16:13</span> Parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ vedanākkhandho nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho ca nirujjhittha vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8191.071641\">2:16:31</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana vedanākkhandho nirujjhissati tassa rūpakkhandho nirujjhitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8204.320221\">2:16:44</span> 144. (Ka) yassa vedanākkhandho nirujjhittha tassa saññākkhandho nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2x-144</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8215.777533\">2:16:55</span> Parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ saññākkhandho nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhittha saññākkhandho ca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8233.123452\">2:17:13</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana saññākkhandho nirujjhissati tassa vedanākkhandho nirujjhitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8252.320097\">2:17:32</span> 145. Yattha rūpakkhandho nirujjhittha…pe…. ^6-2x-145</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8256.642669\">2:17:36</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8261.123999\">2:17:41</span> 146. (Ka) yassa yattha rūpakkhandho nirujjhittha tassa tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2x-146</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8271.031129\">2:17:51</span> Pañcavokāre parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho ca nirujjhittha vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8295.647285\">2:18:15</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhissati tassa tattha rūpakkhandho nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8308.409378\">2:18:28</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ arūpānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho nirujjhittha. Itaresaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhissati rūpakkhandho ca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8333.685644\">2:18:53</span> 147. (Ka) yassa yattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhittha tassa tattha saññākkhandho nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2x-147</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8344.166797\">2:19:04</span> Parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhittha saññākkhandho ca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8366.464929\">2:19:26</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha saññākkhandho nirujjhissati tassa tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8380.441991\">2:19:40</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhittha. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho ca nirujjhissati vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8408.659087\">2:20:08</span> 148. (Ka) yassa rūpakkhandho na nirujjhittha tassa vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissatīti? Natthi. ^6-2x-148</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8422.220639\">2:20:22</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati tassa rūpakkhandho na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8438.353775\">2:20:38</span> 149. (Ka) yassa vedanākkhandho na nirujjhittha tassa saññākkhandho na nirujjhissatīti? Natthi. ^6-2x-149</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8450.851613\">2:20:50</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati tassa vedanākkhandho na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8469.548934\">2:21:09</span> 150. Yattha rūpakkhandho na nirujjhittha…pe…. ^6-2x-150</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8476.928379\">2:21:16</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8479.724052\">2:21:19</span> 151. (Ka) yassa yattha rūpakkhandho na nirujjhittha tassa tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2x-151</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8492.348314\">2:21:32</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ arūpānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ arūpe parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho ca na nirujjhittha, vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8522.36351\">2:22:02</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati tassa tattha rūpakkhandho na nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8533.935208\">2:22:13</span> Pañcavokāre parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho na nirujjhittha. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ arūpe parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati rūpakkhandho ca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8562.735694\">2:22:42</span> 152. (Ka) yassa yattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhittha tassa tattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2x-152</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8575.529199\">2:22:55</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhittha saññākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8600.841814\">2:23:20</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati tassa tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8614.050672\">2:23:34</span> Parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhittha. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>Nirodhavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8649.869082\">2:24:09</span> #### 3. Uppādanirodhavāro ^6-2y-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (1) Paccuppannavāro ^6-2z-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8663.636582\">2:24:23</span> 153. (Ka) yassa rūpakkhandho uppajjati tassa vedanākkhandho nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-2z-153</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8673.218935\">2:24:33</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana vedanākkhandho nirujjhati tassa rūpakkhandho uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8685.710381\">2:24:45</span> 154. (Ka) yassa vedanākkhandho uppajjati tassa saññākkhandho nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-2z-154</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8698.456627\">2:24:58</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana saññākkhandho nirujjhati tassa vedanākkhandho uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8716.645738\">2:25:16</span> 155. (Ka) yattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhatīti? ^6-2z-155</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8724.936837\">2:25:24</span> Asaññasatte tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati, no ca tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhati. Pañcavokāre tattha rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8741.209982\">2:25:41</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana vedanākkhandho nirujjhati tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8752.310001\">2:25:52</span> Arūpe tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhati, no ca tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati. Pañcavokāre tattha vedanākkhandho ca nirujjhati rūpakkhandho ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8768.964615\">2:26:08</span> 156. (Ka) yattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati tattha saññākkhandho nirujjhatīti? Āmantā. ^6-2z-156</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8781.689491\">2:26:21</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana saññākkhandho nirujjhati tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8795.076944\">2:26:35</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8797.878505\">2:26:37</span> 157. (Ka) yassa yattha rūpakkhandho uppajjati tassa tattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-2z-157</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8811.200276\">2:26:51</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha vedanākkhandho nirujjhati tassa tattha rūpakkhandho uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8828.151658\">2:27:08</span> 158. (Ka) yassa yattha vedanākkhandho uppajjati tassa tattha saññākkhandho nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-2z-158</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8838.120182\">2:27:18</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha saññākkhandho nirujjhati tassa tattha vedanākkhandho uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8855.079584\">2:27:35</span> 159. (Ka) yassa rūpakkhandho nuppajjati tassa vedanākkhandho na nirujjhatīti? ^6-2z-159</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8865.457997\">2:27:45</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ vedanākkhandho na nirujjhati. Arūpaṃ upapajjantānaṃ asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpakkhandho ca nuppajjati vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8890.387013\">2:28:10</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana vedanākkhandho na nirujjhati tassa rūpakkhandho nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8902.279782\">2:28:22</span> Pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ rūpakkhandho nuppajjati. Arūpaṃ upapajjantānaṃ asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhati rūpakkhandho ca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8929.194437\">2:28:49</span> 160. (Ka) yassa vedanākkhandho nuppajjati tassa saññākkhandho na nirujjhatīti? ^6-2z-160</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8940.691428\">2:29:00</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ saññākkhandho na nirujjhati. Asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ vedanākkhandho ca nuppajjati saññākkhandho ca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8967.706315\">2:29:27</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana saññākkhandho na nirujjhati tassa vedanākkhandho nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8975.847403\">2:29:35</span> Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ saññākkhandho na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ vedanākkhandho nuppajjati. Asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ saññākkhandho ca na nirujjhati ve