"10956.481755\">3:02:36</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10959.480256\">3:02:39</span> 204. (Ka) yassa yattha rūpakkhandho nuppajjittha tassa tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2-204</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10972.530102\">3:02:52</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ arūpānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ arūpe parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho ca nuppajjittha vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11000.267066\">3:03:20</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati tassa tattha rūpakkhandho nuppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11013.798657\">3:03:33</span> Pañcavokāre parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha rūpakkhandho nuppajjittha. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ arūpe parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati rūpakkhandho ca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11044.826006\">3:04:04</span> 205. (Ka) yassa yattha vedanākkhandho nuppajjittha tassa tattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-2-205</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11054.759835\">3:04:14</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho ca nuppajjittha saññākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11081.817063\">3:04:41</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati tassa tattha vedanākkhandho nuppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11093.728534\">3:04:53</span> Parinibbantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha vedanākkhandho nuppajjittha. Suddhāvāse parinibbantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha saññākkhandho ca na nirujjhissati vedanākkhandho ca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11132.812744\">3:05:32</span> Uppādanirodhavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p>Pavattivāro niṭṭhito.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11144.837079\">3:05:44</span> #### 3. Pariññāvāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p> #### 1. Paccuppannavāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11150.287481\">3:05:50</span> 206. (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānāti so vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānātīti? Āmantā. ^6-2-206</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11161.159396\">3:06:01</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānāti so rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānātīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11175.589882\">3:06:15</span> (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānāti so vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānātīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11190.643225\">3:06:30</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānāti so rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānātīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11205.699207\">3:06:45</span> #### 2. Atītavāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11212.850607\">3:06:52</span> 207. (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānittha so vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-2-207</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11226.384549\">3:07:06</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānittha so rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11240.826306\">3:07:20</span> (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānittha so vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11255.036029\">3:07:35</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānittha so rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11270.317329\">3:07:50</span> #### 3. Anāgatavāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11277.770172\">3:07:57</span> 208. (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānissati so vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānissatīti? Āmantā. ^6-2-208</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11290.643841\">3:08:10</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānissati so rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11305.249941\">3:08:25</span> (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānissati so vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11318.928718\">3:08:38</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissati so rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11333.914986\">3:08:53</span> #### 4. Paccuppannātītavāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11341.343272\">3:09:01</span> 209. (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānāti so vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānitthāti? No. ^6-2-209</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11358.233657\">3:09:18</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānittha so rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānātīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11367.562171\">3:09:27</span> (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānāti so vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11379.53445\">3:09:39</span> Arahā rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānāti, no ca vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānittha. Aggamaggasamaṅgiñca arahantañca ṭhapetvā avasesā puggalā rūpakkhandhañca na parijānanti vedanākkhandhañca na parijānittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11403.361732\">3:10:03</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānittha so rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānātīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11416.192373\">3:10:16</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgī vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānittha, no ca rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānāti. Aggamaggasamaṅgiñca arahantañca ṭhapetvā avasesā puggalā vedanākkhandhañca na parijānittha rūpakkhandhañca na parijānanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11434.495291\">3:10:34</span> #### 5. Paccuppannānāgatavāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11441.739468\">3:10:41</span> 210. (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānāti so vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānissatīti? No. ^6-2-210</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11455.703288\">3:10:55</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānissati so rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānātīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11469.018129\">3:11:09</span> (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānāti so vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11481.361866\">3:11:21</span> Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti te rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānanti, no ca vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissanti. Arahā ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te rūpakkhandhañca na parijānanti vedanākkhandhañca na parijānissanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11505.706593\">3:11:45</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissati so rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānātīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11518.158039\">3:11:58</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgī vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissati, no ca rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānāti. Arahā ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te vedanākkhandhañca na parijānissanti rūpakkhandhañca na parijānanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11540.551055\">3:12:20</span> #### 6. Atītānāgatavāro ^6-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11548.792894\">3:12:28</span> 211. (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānittha so vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānissatīti? No. ^6-2-211</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11561.568897\">3:12:41</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ parijānissati so rūpakkhandhaṃ parijānitthāti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11575.082932\">3:12:55</span> (Ka) yo rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānittha so vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11587.078494\">3:13:07</span> Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti te rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānittha, no ca vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissanti. Aggamaggasamaṅgī ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te rūpakkhandhañca na parijānittha vedanākkhandhañca na parijānissanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11614.934535\">3:13:34</span> (Kha) yo vā pana vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissati so rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11624.221935\">3:13:44</span> Arahā vedanākkhandhaṃ na parijānissati, no ca rūpakkhandhaṃ na parijānittha. Aggamaggasamaṅgī ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te vedanākkhandhañca na parijānissanti rūpakkhandhañca na parijānittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11662.442219\">3:14:22</span> Pariññāvāro.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11666.694568\">3:14:26</span> Khandhayamakapāḷi niṭṭhitā.</p><p><br /></p><p>Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa</p><p><br /></p>","media-time":11678.301}